#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:7
msgid ""
"TXS-10002-2025 信道模型: AWGN / Rayleigh / Rician / 多径频率选择性衰落 / Doppler 时变 / "
"多用户干扰。"
msgstr ""
"TXS-10002-2025 channel models: AWGN / Rayleigh / Rician / multipath "
"frequency-selective fading / Doppler time-varying / multi-user interference."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:9
msgid ""
"SparkLink SLE 工作于 2.4 GHz ISM 频段,典型场景为室内短距通信。 参考 IEEE 802.15.4 / ITU-R "
"P.1238 室内信道参数:"
msgstr ""
"SparkLink SLE operates in the 2.4 GHz ISM band with typical indoor short-"
"range communication scenarios. Reference: IEEE 802.15.4 / ITU-R P.1238 "
"indoor channel parameters:"

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:11
msgid "RMS 时延扩展: 10 ~ 50 ns"
msgstr "RMS delay spread: 10 ~ 50 ns"

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:12
msgid "Rician K 因子: 3 ~ 10 dB (视距)"
msgstr "Rician K factor: 3 ~ 10 dB (line-of-sight)"

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:13
msgid "最大多普勒频移: < 50 Hz (行人速度)"
msgstr "Maximum Doppler shift: < 50 Hz (pedestrian speed)"

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:15
msgid ""
"Doppler 时变信道采用 Jakes 求和正弦模型, 生成具有经典 U 形功率谱密度的 时间相关衰落序列, 自相关函数为 "
"J₀(2π·f_d·Δt)。"
msgstr ""
"Doppler time-varying channel uses the Jakes sum-of-sinusoids model, "
"generating time-correlated fading sequences with the classic U-shaped power "
"spectral density. The autocorrelation function is J₀(2π·f_d·Δt)."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:18
msgid "多用户干扰模型支持同信道干扰和邻信道干扰, 基于 TXS-10002-2025 标准 第 8.3.2 条接收机选择性要求。"
msgstr ""
"The multi-user interference model supports co-channel and adjacent-channel "
"interference, based on TXS-10002-2025 Section 8.3.2 receiver selectivity "
"requirements."

