#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/phy/channel.py:93
msgid ""
"Attributes:     snr_db: 信噪比 (dB)。     channel_type: \"awgn\" | \"rayleigh\" "
"| \"rician\" | \"multipath\"。     rician_k_db: Rician K 因子 (dB), 仅 "
"\"rician\" 模式使用。     pdp: 功率时延谱 [(delay_samples, power_dB), ...], 仅 "
"\"multipath\" 使用。     max_doppler_hz: 最大多普勒频移 (Hz)。0 表示准静态。     "
"symbol_rate_hz: 符号速率 (Hz), 用于计算归一化 Doppler 频移。     n_sinusoids: Jakes "
"模型正弦分量数, 值越大频谱越精确。     seed: 随机种子。"
msgstr ""
"Attributes:     snr_db: Signal-to-noise ratio (dB).     channel_type: "
"\"awgn\" | \"rayleigh\" | \"rician\" | \"multipath\".     rician_k_db: "
"Rician K factor (dB), used only in \"rician\" mode.     pdp: Power delay "
"profile [(delay_samples, power_dB), ...], used only in \"multipath\" mode."
"     max_doppler_hz: Maximum Doppler frequency shift (Hz). 0 means quasi-"
"static.     symbol_rate_hz: Symbol rate (Hz), used to compute the normalized"
" Doppler shift.     n_sinusoids: Number of sinusoidal components in the "
"Jakes model; higher values yield a more accurate spectrum.     seed: Random "
"seed."

